# F10 test: rejecting half-configured extruders.
#
# An extruder with heating options but no 'heater_pin' is a configuration
# mistake, not a heater-less extruder, so both variants must fail to start.
# Neither config is ever reached past the config check, so they share one
# gcode list and their CONFIG lines are both placed after it (the harness
# launches every config it collects when it sees the second one).
DICTIONARY atmega2560.dict
SHOULD_FAIL
M105
CONFIG extruder_no_heater_sensor_only.cfg
CONFIG extruder_no_heater_stray_options.cfg
